A pair whose key side is empty is rejected separately from a missing `=`, so the message
points at the empty key rather than at the syntax.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md =value
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: empty key in pair: '=value'
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
